# POLLY, cow: a new song plays the first factory style (Pop); its sections get user patterns of their own only
# when they change (copy-on-write). A take into Main A: Main A becomes P01 (Pop's Main A with the note), saved;
# a mixer change on Main B: P02; the other sections stay Pop's. Across a reboot.
wait 300
expect song1_style1 33
expect slot1_nev 69
expect dirty 0
tap PLAY
wait 2000
press SEL
tapkey b1
release SEL
wait 2500
expect sect 2
tap REC
expect song1_style1 0
expect recording 1
tapkey 7
wait 600
tap REC
tap PLAY
wait 100
expect slot1_nev 70
expect dirty 1
expect song1_style2 34
# Main B's volume on the Mixer page, stopped: the section playing is Main A, so Main B first (SEL + b2, PLAY)
press SEL
tapkey b2
release SEL
tap PLAY
wait 300
expect sect 3
tap PLAY
wait 100
tap FX
spin K1 -10
wait 100
expect song1_style2 1
tap SAVE
wait 50
expect dirty 0
expect pat0_nev 70
expect pat1_nev >20
expect song1_style0 32
expect song1_style5 37
reboot
wait 300
expect song1_style1 0
expect song1_style2 1
expect slot1_nev 70
expect song2_style1 33
